    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>These largely non-destructive tests provide critical insights about the durability and quality of materials and roadworks.</p>
<p>Our accredited laboratories and mobile facilities are equipped to perform the following sample and field testing services according to testing standards set by ASTM, SANAS, BSI and more.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
    <heroLargeHeading>
      <Value><![CDATA[Sample & Field Testing]]></Value>
